    <item>
      <title>DHL关税影响，亚洲投资，健康后勤的首席执行官</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/dhl-ceo-on-tariff-impact-asia-trade-health-logistics-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[DHL首席执行官托比亚斯·迈耶（Tobias Meyer）讨论了特朗普总统关税政策的变化如何影响商业前景和客户情绪。迈耶（Meyer）告诉彭博电视台（Bloomberg Television），“仍然有很多不确定性”，该公司的客户正在“试图弄清楚在哪里进行生产，将库存放在哪里以最好的位置”。他还谈到了DHL在东南亚的投资以及医疗保健物流的扩张。 （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/dhl-ceo-on-tariff-impact-asia-trade-health-logistics-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 01:31:16 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>技术股票在关税缓刑方面的混合信号中攀升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/asian-tech-stocks-climb-amid-mixed-signals-on-tariff-reprieve</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普政府宣布对手机，计算机和消费电子产品的关税停顿之后，技术股有所增加，尽管官员们后来轻描淡写了缓刑。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/asian-tech-stocks-climb-amid-mixed-signals-on-tariff-reprieve</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 00:45:15 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>高盛本月第二次削减中国股票的目标</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/goldman-sachs-cuts-targets-for-china-stocks-second-time-in-april</link>
      <description><![CDATA[高盛集团公司（Goldman Sachs Group Inc.）的战略家本月第二次削减了中国主要股票指数的目标，理由是与美国与美国的贸易紧张局势加剧。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/goldman-sachs-cuts-targets-for-china-stocks-second-time-in-april</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 00:35:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票期货随着交易者的消化简短技术关税缓刑而上升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/stock-futures-rise-as-traders-digest-brief-tech-tariff-reprieve</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着投资者从特朗普政府进行了对电话，计算机和受欢迎的消费电子电子产品的互惠关税豁免的来回征收，美国股票期货获得了。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/stock-futures-rise-as-traders-digest-brief-tech-tariff-reprieve</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 23:00:47 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票，随着特朗普暂停技术关税，期货上升：市场包裹</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普总统在一系列消费电子产品上停止进口职责后，亚洲股票在公开场合晋升，在市场上波动的一周后，提升了情绪。美元削弱了日元。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:40:41 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>贸易战转变和伊朗的石油稳定</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-april-14</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于交易者权衡了贸易战中最新的美国行动，以及华盛顿和德黑兰之间的“建设性”周末讨论，石油稳定了四年低点。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-april-14</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:36:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>当关税传奇卷起时，美元降至新鲜的2025低点</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</link>
      <description><![CDATA[当交易者对受欢迎的消费电子产品的关税征收关税和总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）的征收，这笔钱连续第五次撤退，而唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）则轻描淡写了他对技术领域的豁免。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:09:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>苹果在特朗普关税特许权之前处于危机的边缘</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/apple-was-on-brink-of-crisis-before-tariff-concession-from-trump</link>
      <description><![CDATA[苹果公司（Apple Inc.）设法避开了自大流行以来最大的危机；至少目前。]]></description>
